    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's a FIGHTSTONE right next to your heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fightstone is an organ that is in charge of <strong>willpower</strong>,<strong> motivation</strong>, and<strong> foresight. </strong>It is the duty of prospectors like Hallow to ensure we have the strength of suppress the monster inside of us. And it is Hallow's duty to defeat the awakened monsters that seek to destroy us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/20b34d3969a08319209d103e9d57e28a.poster.avif?t=1753730685\" width=800 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/20b34d3969a08319209d103e9d57e28a.webm?t=1753730685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train your FIGHTSTONE so that a monster doesn't take control of you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true monsters lie inside all of us. They're usually asleep but they awaken once you experience turmoil. If that happens, the prospectors will come hunting for that rock in your chest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/a9d02b30341d505c58ca08ae9ecc6edc.poster.avif?t=1753730685\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/a9d02b30341d505c58ca08ae9ecc6edc.webp?t=1753730685\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=233 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You're not alone in this</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends who will support you. This isn't a burden you need to endure by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/2cbd658a217b6d7f959e4af24997207e.avif?t=1753730685\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging monsters with different attack patterns and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters; Enemies wander the world and will attack you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable equipment to give you an edge in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 action buttons to minimize complexity - easy to learn, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack and artwork</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's a FIGHTSTONE right next to your heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fightstone is an organ that is in charge of <strong>willpower</strong>,<strong> motivation</strong>, and<strong> foresight. </strong>It is the duty of prospectors like Hallow to ensure we have the strength of suppress the monster inside of us. And it is Hallow's duty to defeat the awakened monsters that seek to destroy us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/20b34d3969a08319209d103e9d57e28a.poster.avif?t=1753730685\" width=800 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/20b34d3969a08319209d103e9d57e28a.webm?t=1753730685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train your FIGHTSTONE so that a monster doesn't take control of you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true monsters lie inside all of us. They're usually asleep but they awaken once you experience turmoil. If that happens, the prospectors will come hunting for that rock in your chest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/a9d02b30341d505c58ca08ae9ecc6edc.poster.avif?t=1753730685\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/a9d02b30341d505c58ca08ae9ecc6edc.webp?t=1753730685\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=233 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You're not alone in this</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends who will support you. This isn't a burden you need to endure by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508010/extras/2cbd658a217b6d7f959e4af24997207e.avif?t=1753730685\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging monsters with different attack patterns and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters; Enemies wander the world and will attack you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable equipment to give you an edge in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 action buttons to minimize complexity - easy to learn, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack and artwork</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Use your reflexes to defeat powerful enemies in this RPG with combat inspired by Punch Out. Journey to save everyone from those terrible monsters\u2026 before you become one yourself.",
